* ADP7118 1.8V Regulator
V1 IN 0 3.3
C1 IN 0 2.2u
C2 OUT 0 2.2u

* Resistor divider for 1.8V output (Vref = 1.2V)
* Vout = 1.2V * (1 + R1/R2) => 1.8V = 1.2V * (1 + 5k/10k)
R1 OUT SENSE 5k
R2 SENSE 0 10k

* 50mA load at 1.8V (R = V/I = 1.8/0.05 = 36 ohms)
Rload OUT 0 36

* ADP7118 LDO Subcircuit (IN, EN, GND, SENSE, OUT)
* EN is tied to IN for automatic startup
X1 IN IN 0 SENSE OUT ADP7118

.lib ADI.lib
.tran 10m
.end
